### ===============================================================
### Satoria Engineer Logbook — Manual API Testing Collection
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### ===============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@api = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1

### 1. Health Check Server
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Health Check API v1
GET {{api}}/health

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### AUTENTIKASI (LOGIN DUMMY USERS)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### 3. Login sebagai TEKNISI (Budi Santoso)
# @name loginTeknisi
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "teknisi@satoria.co.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Simpan token teknisi dari respons di atas:
@tokenTeknisi = {{loginTeknisi.response.body.data.token}}

### 4. Login sebagai SUPERVISOR (Ir. Hendra Gunawan)
# @name loginSpv
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "spv@satoria.co.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Simpan token supervisor dari respons di atas:
@tokenSpv = {{loginSpv.response.body.data.token}}

### 5. Login sebagai ADMIN (Administrator Sistem)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin@satoria.co.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Simpan token admin dari respons di atas:
@tokenAdmin = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### 6. Cek Profil Pengguna Aktif (Me)
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTeknisi}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### MODUL MASTER DATA
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### 7. Ambil Data Master Plants
GET {{api}}/master/plants
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTeknisi}}

### 8. Ambil Data Master Machines (filter Plant 1)
GET {{api}}/master/machines?plant_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTeknisi}}

### 9. Ambil Data Master Shifts
GET {{api}}/master/shifts
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTeknisi}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### MODUL LOGBOOK (TEKNISI)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### 10. Ambil Daftar Logbook Saya (Teknisi)
GET {{api}}/logbooks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTeknisi}}

### 11. Buat Logbook Baru (Submit Pending)
POST {{api}}/logbooks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTeknisi}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plant_id": 1,
  "shift_id": 1,
  "machine_id": 1,
  "sub_machine_id": 1,
  "task_date": "2026-10-18",
  "start_time": "08:30",
  "end_time": "11:00",
  "sparepart": "Bearing SKF 6204",
  "activity_description": "Preventive maintenance rutin: pelumasan bearing pompa dan kalibrasi presisi nozzle.",
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### 12. Simpan Logbook sebagai DRAFT
POST {{api}}/logbooks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTeknisi}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plant_id": 1,
  "shift_id": 2,
  "machine_id": 2,
  "task_date": "2026-10-18",
  "start_time": "16:00",
  "end_time": "17:30",
  "sparepart": "-",
  "activity_description": "Draft catatan: pengecekan suhu awal motor sealer.",
  "status": "DRAFT"
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### MODUL APPROVAL & SUPERVISOR
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### 13. Supervisor Melihat Ringkasan Frekuensi Tim Teknisi
GET {{api}}/supervisor/team-overview
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSpv}}

### 14. Supervisor Menyetujui Logbook (Ganti ID sesuai logbook pending)
POST {{api}}/logbooks/2/approval
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSpv}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "notes": "Pekerjaan pemeliharaan telah diperiksa dan disetujui sesuai SOP."
}

### 15. Supervisor Menolak Logbook (Wajib catatan perbaikan)
POST {{api}}/logbooks/2/approval
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSpv}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "REJECTED",
  "notes": "Harap sertakan nomor part bearing lama yang diganti dan foto sebelum/sesudah pengerjaan."
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### MODUL EKSPOR LAPORAN
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### 16. Ekspor Laporan Tim dalam Format JSON
GET {{api}}/reports/export?format=json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSpv}}

### 17. Unduh Laporan Tim Format Excel (.xlsx)
GET {{api}}/reports/export?format=excel
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSpv}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### MODUL ADMIN & AUDIT TRAIL
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### 18. Admin Melihat Daftar Seluruh Pengguna
GET {{api}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 19. Admin Melihat Audit Trail (user_activities)
GET {{api}}/admin/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
